 **Test-model counts:** 337, 332, 267, 215, 331 and 236 match.\n- **Wording:** the closure-above-1 explanation and the `>20` meaning are correct.\n\nI have no change to ask for. \n---\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "ba1c654d-8ad5-5637-9f53-cbb7774cb38c", "at": 1795638345.6959891, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 63032, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "f1f9ca88671b06068b64f911b5112b32", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "718fc650-f87f-5b8d-9883-c826957bf000", "at": 1795638345.6994183, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 63033, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "f1f9ca88671b06068b64f911b5112b32", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "da3dc21a-1baa-51d8-b68e-0270464b3a4b", "at": 1795638345.702066, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 63034, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "f1f9ca88671b06068b64f911b5112b32", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "08004d12-877f-5a2d-82e7-5cb93f074f89", "at": 1795638345.7631373, "until": 1795638345.7834013, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 63035, "layer": "worker", "category": "collaborate", "kind": "collaboration.request", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "f1f9ca88671b06068b64f911b5112b32", "trust": "system-confirmed", "outcome": "200", "label": "collaborate → 200", "repository": "